<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">See table <a href="#A1.T5" title="In Appendix A Additional Experimental Details ‣ Calibrating MLLM-as-a-judge via Multimodal Bayesian Prompt Ensembles" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Tab.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> for details on experimental factors, clustering configuration, and other hyperparameters.</p>
